{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47502","headline":"七言 十一 · 吕岩","name":"七言 十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"遥指高峰笑一声，红霞紫雾面前生。\n每於廛市无人识，长到山中有鹤行。\n时弄玉蟾驱鬼魅，夜煎金鼎煮琼英。\n他时若赴蓬莱洞，知我仙家有姓名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47502.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47502","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}